ver.If your company or institution wishes to license Everson Mono for use on many machines or a network, please get in touch with me directly. If your company is interested in licensing Everson Mono for bundling with your software, please get in touch with me directly. Its clean, simple design makes Everson Mono an excellent default ÒfallbackÓ font when no other, more ÒtypographicalÓ fonts are available for a specific script or Unicode character.How to pay your shareware fee:By PayPal (www.paypal.com) to me at my e-mail address.If youÕre in Ireland, you can send me a personal cheque or bank draft for EUR 30.38 (EUR 25.00 + EUR 5.38 VAT @ 21.5%).If youÕre in the US, you can send me a personal cheque in US dollars drawn on a US bank, but you should check a bank or currency converter for the current rate.If youÕre elsewhere in the world, you can send me an international bank draft for EUR 25.00.Michael Everson, Evertype, Cnoc Sceichin, Leac an Anfa, Cathair na Mart, Co. Mhaigh Eo, Eire, 2011-03-01 everson@evertype.comhttp://www.evertype.com/emono/emshareware.htmlEverson Mono␀C␀o␀p␀y␀r␀i␀g␀h␀t␀ ␀(␀c␀)␀ ␀2␀0␀1␀5␀ ␀b␀y␀ ␀M␀i␀c␀h␀a␀e␀l␀ ␀E␀v␀e␀r␀s␀o␀n␀.␀ ␀A␀l␀l␀ ␀r␀i␀g␀h␀t␀s␀ ␀r␀e␀s␀e␀r␀v␀e␀d␀.␀E␀v␀e␀r␀s␀o␀n␀ ␀M␀o␀n␀o␀R␀e␀g␀u␀l␀a␀r␀M␀i␀c␀h␀a␀e␀l␀E␀v␀e␀r␀s␀o␀n␀:␀ ␀E␀v␀e␀r␀s␀o␀n␀ ␀M␀o␀n␀o␀:␀ ␀2␀0␀1␀5␀E␀v␀e␀r␀s␀o␀n␀M␀o␀n␀o␀V␀e␀r␀s␀i␀o␀n␀ ␀7␀.␀0␀0␀0␀E␀v␀e␀r␀s␀o␀n␀M␀o␀n␀o␀E␀v␀e␀r␀s␀o␀n␀ ␀M␀o␀n␀o␀ ␀i␀s␀ ␀a␀ ␀t␀r␀a␀d␀e␀m␀a␀r␀k␀ ␀o␀f␀ ␀M␀i␀c␀h␀a␀e␀l␀ ␀E␀v␀e␀r␀s␀o␀n␀.␀M␀i␀c␀h␀a␀e␀l␀ ␀E␀v␀e␀r␀s␀o␀n␀M␀i␀c␀h␀a␀e␀l␀ ␀E␀v␀e␀r␀s␀o␀n␀C␀o␀p␀y␀r␀i␀g␀h␀t␀ ␀(␀c␀)␀ ␀1␀9␀9␀4␀-␀2␀0␀1␀5␀ ␀b␀y␀ ␀M␀i␀c␀h␀a␀e␀l␀ ␀E␀v␀e␀r␀s␀o␀n␀.␀ ␀A␀l␀l␀ ␀r␀i␀g␀h␀t␀s␀ ␀r␀e␀s␀e␀r␀v␀e␀d␀.␀e␀v␀e␀r␀t␀y␀p␀e␀.␀c␀o␀m␀e␀v␀e␀r␀t␀y␀p␀e␀.␀c␀o␀m␀E␀v␀e␀r␀s␀o␀n␀ ␀M␀o␀n␀o␀ ␀c␀o␀p␀y␀r␀i␀g␀h␀t␀ ␀n␀o␀t␀i␀c␀e␀␀␀E␀v␀e␀r␀s␀o␀n␀ ␀M␀o␀n␀o␀ ␀i␀s␀ ␀c␀o␀p␀y␀r␀i␀g␀h␀t␀ ␀©␀ ␀1␀9␀9␀4␀-␀2␀0␀1␀5␀ ␀M␀i␀c␀h␀a␀e␀l␀ ␀E␀v␀e␀r␀s␀o␀n␀.␀ ␀A␀l␀l␀ ␀r␀i␀g␀h␀t␀s␀ ␀i␀n␀c␀l␀u␀d␀i␀n␀g␀ ␀m␀o␀r␀a␀l␀ ␀r␀i␀g␀h␀t␀s␀ ␀r␀e␀s␀e␀r␀v␀e␀d␀.␀ ␀E␀v␀e␀r␀s␀o